{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused on the bare essentials of 3D modelling, picoCAD blends simplicity with creativity, letting you make low-poly 3D models with just a few clicks. Whether you are a total beginner, or an expert, picoCAD is a unique and approachable tool to express your art in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/615d5e6b730285655cee77b1f4d2e9dd.poster.avif?t=1773663905\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/615d5e6b730285655cee77b1f4d2e9dd.webm?t=1773663905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/615d5e6b730285655cee77b1f4d2e9dd.mp4?t=1773663905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/a9e04d34c4dd01e34b68c523443610f1.poster.avif?t=1773663905\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/a9e04d34c4dd01e34b68c523443610f1.webm?t=1773663905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/a9e04d34c4dd01e34b68c523443610f1.mp4?t=1773663905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focused toolset</strong>: Create retro-style models without any prior experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in texture editor</strong>: See your pixel art appear on your model as you draw it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Motion tools</strong>: Make your models move with simple animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique aesthetic</strong>: Embrace the charm of low-poly, low-res visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GIF export</strong>: Instantly share animations on social media</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GLTF &amp; OBJ/MTL export</strong>: Bring your models into any modern game engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sprite sheet export</strong>: Easily create sprite sheets of any number of frames and size</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/a3e1755c6c148f6fe1d078534e0cf077.poster.avif?t=1773663905\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/a3e1755c6c148f6fe1d078534e0cf077.webm?t=1773663905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>-</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S NEW?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're upgrading from picoCAD 1, you're in for a treat. Re-written from scratch, picoCAD 2 offers a lot of improvements over the original. Think NES to SNES. Here are some highlights:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No project limits</strong>: Build as big (or small) as you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New texture editor</strong>: Fully integrated with your workflow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animation tools</strong>: Make your models move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Per-pixel depth sorting</strong>: Clean visuals with no z-fighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Palette and shading editors</strong>: Fine-tune your color ramps and lighting style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mesh editing control</strong>: Hide/show and lock parts of your model as needed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom export settings</strong>: You decide what it looks like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Refined interface</strong>: Better layout, fonts, and readability</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3675940?t=1773663905","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/1674b23a094bd468912a3b7f40b6c0826048bcea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773663905","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/c8b0e4825ff5b95e459fe123da0ceda475b6c8b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773663905","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/c8b0e4825ff5b95e459fe123da0ceda475b6c8b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773663905","content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focused on the bare essentials of 3D modelling, picoCAD blends simplicity with creativity, letting you make low-poly 3D models with just a few clicks. Whether you are a total beginner, or an expert, picoCAD is a unique and approachable tool to express your art in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/615d5e6b730285655cee77b1f4d2e9dd.poster.avif?t=1773663905\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/615d5e6b730285655cee77b1f4d2e9dd.webm?t=1773663905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/615d5e6b730285655cee77b1f4d2e9dd.mp4?t=1773663905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/a9e04d34c4dd01e34b68c523443610f1.poster.avif?t=1773663905\" width=256 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/a9e04d34c4dd01e34b68c523443610f1.webm?t=1773663905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/a9e04d34c4dd01e34b68c523443610f1.mp4?t=1773663905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focused toolset</strong>: Create retro-style models without any prior experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built-in texture editor</strong>: See your pixel art appear on your model as you draw it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Motion tools</strong>: Make your models move with simple animations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique aesthetic</strong>: Embrace the charm of low-poly, low-res visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GIF export</strong>: Instantly share animations on social media</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GLTF &amp; OBJ/MTL export</strong>: Bring your models into any modern game engine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sprite sheet export</strong>: Easily create sprite sheets of any number of frames and size</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/a3e1755c6c148f6fe1d078534e0cf077.poster.avif?t=1773663905\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/extras/a3e1755c6c148f6fe1d078534e0cf077.webm?t=1773663905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>-</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT'S NEW?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're upgrading from picoCAD 1, you're in for a treat. Re-written from scratch, picoCAD 2 offers a lot of improvements over the original. Think NES to SNES. Here are some highlights:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No project limits</strong>: Build as big (or small) as you want</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New texture editor</strong>: Fully integrated with your workflow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animation tools</strong>: Make your models move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Per-pixel depth sorting</strong>: Clean visuals with no z-fighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Palette and shading editors</strong>: Fine-tune your color ramps and lighting style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mesh editing control</strong>: Hide/show and lock parts of your model as needed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom export settings</strong>: You decide what it looks like</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Refined interface</strong>: Better layout, fonts, and readability</p></li></ul>","developers":["Johan Peitz"],"genres":[{"description":"Animation & Modeling","id":"51"},{"description":"Design & Illustration","id":"53"},{"description":"Game Development","id":"60"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675940/c6d5aae377e5bb793bf2f530c9389bb6c77502a5/header.jpg?t=1773663905","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated Graphics<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 100 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated Sound card</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trai